      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تضّيح</span></b>  <i>It</i> (milk) <i>became what is termed</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَيَاح</span>; (K;) i. e. <i>it was diluted with water, and
stirred about until it became of a uniform consistence:</i> and so any medicine, or poison. (TA.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <i>He</i> (a man) <i>drank what is termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَيَاح</span>.
(K.)

